{
    "_comment": "RICH FUSED-PERCEPTION co-design schedule: the FULL sensor-fusion stack the K1 could run, not just the 3-net flight subset. Every net is sensor-tied with a real job; this is a scheduling/DSE study of the target perception stack (transformer head + secondary detector are the fuller perception the sensor suite enables; the live flight demo currently runs {mlp_control, fused_full, yolo}). Unlocks the levers we were leaving idle: enable_impls=true so ffn/attn choose IME (cluster-0 vmadot) vs RVV-shard; THREE shardable dominating/heavy nets (yolo_64x96 detector, ffn GEMM, dronet); a transformer head with real internal deps (attn -> ffn); multi-rate windowing (50 Hz control/nav, ~10 Hz perception).",
